#: view/fm160/gnss.js
msgid "\"In view\" is what the module itself reports, and \"parsed\" is how many of those satellites were actually present in the NMEA. They are shown side by side on purpose: if they differ, the answer was truncated, and that is a transport problem rather than a sky problem."
msgstr "「可见」是模组自己报告的，而「已解析」是这些卫星里真正出现在 NMEA 中的数量。两者并排显示是有意为之：如果不一致，说明应答被截断了，那是传输问题而不是天空的问题。"

#: view/fm160/gnss.js
msgid "\"Uninterpreted\" counts sentences that are well formed but carry nothing this daemon uses, such as VTG and TXT - a non-zero value there is not a problem."
msgstr "「未解释」统计的是格式正确、但不含本守护进程所用内容的语句，例如 VTG 和 TXT——这项非零不是问题。"

#: view/fm160/cells.js
msgid "%d band token(s) could not be decoded and are shown elsewhere or omitted. The daemon is talking to a firmware whose encoding differs from the documented one, so locking is best avoided until that is understood."
msgstr "有 %d 个频段 token 无法解码，已在别处显示或省略。守护进程面对的固件其编码与手册记载不同，在弄清之前最好避免锁定。"

