msgstr "。它只被记录，不被解释。"

#: view/fm160/gnss.js
msgid "0 satellites in view. On this hardware that is the normal reading indoors - the module has antennas, but it needs a view of the sky to find anything."
msgstr "可见 0 颗卫星。在这套硬件上，室内读到这个数是正常的——模组有天线，但需要看见天空才能搜到目标。"

#: view/fm160/gnss.js
msgid "A GSV sentence carried one field more than the standard describes (signal id)"
msgstr "有一条 GSV 语句比标准多带了一个字段（signal id）"

#: view/fm160/dial.js
msgid "A failed round triggers a redial; after the consecutive-failure threshold the module USB profile is bounced and reloaded; after the 24 h budget is exhausted the watchdog stops by itself."
msgstr "一轮失败先触发重拨；连续失败达到阈值后模块 USB 配置会被弹掉重载；24 小时预算耗尽后看门狗自行停止。"

#: view/fm160/sms.js
msgid "A message longer than 160 GSM 7-bit characters is split into numbered segments and sent as several messages; the modem is never asked to do the splitting. The count below is a preview - the daemon decides the real answer when it encodes the text."
msgstr "超过 160 个 GSM 7 比特字符的消息会被拆成带编号的分段，以多条消息发送；从不要求模组来做拆分。下面的计数只是预览——真正的结果由守护进程在编码正文时决定。"

#: view/fm160/sms.js
msgid "A modem without a SIM answers AT+CPMS? with ERROR; that is the usual cause here, and it is not a fault in the daemon. The setup is retried a few times and then left alone, because a question whose answer is a ten-second ERROR must not be asked on a timer."
msgstr "没有 SIM 卡的模组会用 ERROR 回答 AT+CPMS?；这是这里最常见的原因，而且不是守护进程的故障。设置会重试几次然后就不再多问，因为一个要花十秒才回 ERROR 的问题绝不该被定时器反复询问。"

#: view/fm160/gnss.js
msgid "A non-zero \"bad checksum\" is: it means the module sent a sentence that does not match its own checksum, and that one sentence was discarded while the rest of the block was kept."
msgstr "而「校验和错误」非零则是问题：它表示模组发出的某条语句与其自身校验和不符，该语句被丢弃，块中其余内容保留。"

#: view/fm160/sms.js
msgid "A number and a message are both required."
msgstr "号码和消息正文都必填。"

#: view/fm160/usb.js
msgid "A profile change is already in progress."
msgstr "已经有一次配置切换在进行中。"

#: view/fm160/usb.js
msgid "A profile change left the module unreachable."
msgstr "一次 USB 配置切换后模组失联了。"

#: view/fm160/sms.js
msgid "A sent message cannot be recalled."
msgstr "已发送的消息无法撤回。"

#: view/fm160/debug.js
msgid "A text report of the state fm160d holds and the log lines it remembers, for a bug report. It reads only the daemon's cached state - it sends nothing to the modem, so asking for it cannot disturb what it is describing."
msgstr "一份文本报告，包含 fm160d 持有的状态与它记住的日志行，用于提交故障报告。它只读取守护进程缓存的状态——不会向模组发送任何内容，因此索取它不会打扰它所描述的对象。"

#: view/fm160/gnss.js
msgid "AGPS is read-only in this version. It is displayed because it decides how long the receiver takes to get its first fix, and because a wrong server looks exactly like a weak signal from the outside."
msgstr "本版本的 AGPS 是只读的。之所以显示，是因为它决定接收机拿到首次定位要花多久，也因为从外部看，服务器配错和信号弱的表现一模一样。"

