#: view/fm160/usb.js
msgid "The ECM profile is dialled by fm160d itself, and a"
msgstr "ECM 配置由 fm160d 自己拨，另有一个"

#: view/fm160/cells.js
msgid "The RAT preference is left untouched - only the band list changes."
msgstr "RAT 偏好保持不变——只有频段列表会变。"

#: view/fm160/cells.js
msgid "The answer also contained the \"automatic band selection\" marker, which normally means \"unrestricted\"."
msgstr "应答里还带有「自动选频」标记，这通常意味着「无限制」。"

#: view/fm160/cells.js
msgid "The current connection drops while the modem re-scans."
msgstr "模组重新扫描时当前连接会中断。"

#: view/fm160/sms.js
msgid "The daemon has not finished asking the modem whether it can handle SMS."
msgstr "守护进程还没问完模组是否支持短信。"

#: view/fm160/gnss.js
msgid "The daemon reads the setting back after writing it, and only reports success once the modem agrees - so a failure here means the value was not applied."
msgstr "守护进程写入后会回读该设置，只有模组确认后才报告成功——因此这里失败就意味着值没有生效。"

#: view/fm160/usb.js
msgid "The daemon refused the switch"
msgstr "守护进程拒绝了这次切换"

#: view/fm160/gnss.js
msgid "The engine keeps running throughout; no reset is involved."
msgstr "整个过程引擎持续运行，不涉及复位。"

#: view/fm160/cells.js
msgid "The following values will be written to the modem:"
msgstr "以下值将写入模组："

#: view/fm160/mwan.js
msgid "The hotplug hook re-runs the registration on every interface up/down, so plugging or unplugging a cable is enough - no save needed."
msgstr "hotplug 钩子会在每个接口 up/down 时重跑注册，插拔网线即可生效——无需保存。"

#: view/fm160/gnss.js
msgid "The last answer contained no NMEA sentence."
msgstr "上一次应答里没有 NMEA 语句。"

#: view/fm160/sms.js
msgid "The modem accepted the capability questions but the storage could not be brought into use, and it gave no error text. See the diagnostics below."
msgstr "模组接受了能力查询，但存储无法启用，而且没有给出错误文本。见下方的诊断。"

#: view/fm160/usb.js
msgid "The modem disappears from the USB bus and comes back as a different device, so the network drops for roughly 30-90 s. fm160d reads the profile back afterwards: if it did not change it rolls back once, and if the module never answers it stops and says so above."
msgstr "模组会从 USB 总线上消失、再以另一个设备回来，因此网络中断约 30–90 秒。之后 fm160d 会回读配置：如果没变就回滚一次；如果模组始终不应答，它就停下来并在上方说明。"

#: view/fm160/sms.js
msgid "The modem has no copy of this one; only the entry held here is removed."
msgstr "模组没有这条的副本；只会删除这里保存的这一条。"

#: view/fm160/sms.js
msgid "The modem has not accepted the SMS setup - see the message at the top of this page."
msgstr "模组没有接受短信设置——见本页顶部的提示。"

#: view/fm160/sms.js
msgid "The modem has not accepted the SMS setup, so it cannot be asked for messages."
msgstr "模组没有接受短信设置，因此无法向它索取消息。"

#: view/fm160/sms.js
msgid "The modem has not accepted the SMS setup, so sending and refreshing are disabled. Nothing below has been lost: the list still shows messages the daemon kept from earlier."
msgstr "模组没有接受短信设置，因此发送与刷新被禁用。下面的内容并没有丢：列表里仍然显示守护进程此前保存的消息。"

#: view/fm160/sms.js
msgid "The modem has not accepted the SMS setup."
msgstr "模组没有接受短信设置。"

#: view/fm160/gnss.js
msgid "The modem has not answered AT+GTGPSCFG=? yet, so changing the satellite combination is disabled. The setting is stored, and a value the modem does not accept could not be taken back by guessing."
msgstr "模组尚未回答 AT+GTGPSCFG=?，因此禁止修改卫星组合。该设置是持久的，而模组不接受的值无法靠猜来撤回。"

#: view/fm160/usb.js
msgid "The modem has not answered AT+GTUSBMODE=?, so nothing may be chosen."
msgstr "模组尚未回答 AT+GTUSBMODE=?，因此没有可选项。"

#: view/fm160/cells.js
msgid "The modem has not answered the capability queries (AT+GTACT=? / AT+GTCELLLOCK=?) yet, so writing is disabled. Both settings are persistent, and a value the modem does not accept cannot be taken back by guessing."
msgstr "模组尚未回答能力查询（AT+GTACT=? / AT+GTCELLLOCK=?），因此禁止写入。这两项设置都是持久的，而模组不接受的值无法靠猜来撤回。"

#: view/fm160/cells.js
msgid "The modem is currently restricted to %d bands."
msgstr "模组当前被限制在 %d 个频段。"

#: view/fm160/sms.js
msgid "The modem is listing what it holds. The list refreshes itself when it answers."
msgstr "模组正在列出它保存的消息。它应答后列表会自行刷新。"

#: view/fm160/cells.js
msgid "The modem reported no bands at all."
msgstr "模组没有报告任何频段。"

#: view/fm160/gnss.js
msgid "The modem reports a separate value set for each field of AT+GTGPSCFG. Only x=%d is the satellite combination and only its set below can be written; the other fields are listed so that their numbers are not read as combinations."
msgstr "模组为 AT+GTGPSCFG 的每个字段报告一组独立的值。只有 x=%d 是卫星组合，因此只有它下面那组可以写入；列出其他字段是为了避免把它们的数值误读成组合。"

#: view/fm160/cells.js
msgid "The modem reports no carrier aggregation. Note that a modem with no active data connection answers this query with a bare OK, so an empty table here is normal."
msgstr "模组没有报告载波聚合。注意：没有活动数据连接的模组会用一句裸 OK 回答此查询，所以这里表格为空是正常的。"

#: view/fm160/sms.js
msgid "The modem said"
msgstr "模组说"

#: view/fm160/cells.js
msgid "The modem stores this in its own flash and only applies it after a UE reset. This page never resets the modem - do not switch it to a mode without an AT port to \"force\" it. The value is in place and will take effect on the next power cycle."
msgstr "模组把它存在自己的 flash 里，并且只在 UE 复位之后才生效。本页面从不复位模组——不要为了「强制」生效而把它切到没有 AT 口的模式。值已经写入，会在下次断电重启后生效。"

#: view/fm160/cells.js
msgid "The modem will re-scan the whole band set and the current connection will drop for a few seconds."
msgstr "模组会重新扫描整个频段集合，当前连接会中断几秒。"

#: view/fm160/usb.js
msgid "The module is already in profile"
msgstr "模组已经处于配置"

#: view/fm160/usb.js
msgid "The module is restarting in profile"
msgstr "模组正在重启到配置"

#: view/fm160/usb.js
msgid "The module will restart in profile"
msgstr "模组将重启到配置"

#: view/fm160/gnss.js
msgid "The only documented combination this modem accepts is already the one in use."
msgstr "本模组接受的唯一有手册记载的组合，正是当前使用的这个。"

#: view/fm160/usb.js
msgid "The profile it is in now is not known, so there is nothing to go back to."
msgstr "它当前所在的配置未知，因此没有可回退的目标。"

#: view/fm160/usb.js
msgid "The profile list could not be read"
msgstr "配置清单读取失败"

#: view/fm160/usb.js
msgid "The profile the module is in is read back with AT+GTUSBMODE? rather than remembered, because 17 and 32 share a USB ID and so do 18 and 33 - the USB descriptors alone cannot tell which one is active."
msgstr "模组当前处在哪个配置是用 AT+GTUSBMODE? 读回来的，而不是记下来的，因为 17 与 32 共用同一个 USB ID、18 与 33 也一样——单看 USB 描述符无法分辨生效的是哪一个。"

#: view/fm160/gnss.js
msgid "The receiver needs a moment after switching on; one or two of these in a row is the measured normal."
msgstr "接收机开启后需要一点时间；连续出现一两次这种情况是实测的正常现象。"

#: view/fm160/gnss.js
msgid "The receiver stops, and at least one NMEA read will answer ERROR until it is switched on again."
msgstr "接收机停止，并且在重新打开之前，至少会有一次 NMEA 读取回答 ERROR。"

#: view/fm160/mwan.js
msgid "The registration below is written to /etc/config/mwan3, but without the package installed it does nothing. Install it with"
msgstr "以下注册会写入 /etc/config/mwan3，但没装该包不会生效。安装命令："

#: view/fm160/gnss.js
msgid "The setting is not stored by the module, so it will be off again after the next power cycle unless autostart is enabled."
msgstr "模组不保存该设置，因此除非启用自动启动，下次断电重启后它会再次关闭。"

#: view/fm160/mwan.js
msgid "The status snapshot failed"
msgstr "状态快照获取失败"

#: view/fm160/usb.js
msgid "The switch has been sent. The module is restarting; expect it to be gone for 30-90 s. This page will follow it."
msgstr "切换命令已发出。模组正在重启；预计它会消失 30–90 秒。本页面会跟着它。"

#: view/fm160/usb.js
msgid "The switch request failed"
msgstr "切换请求失败"

#: view/fm160/sms.js
msgid "The two multi-segment counters are the evidence for one specific question: whether a PDU that spans more than one USB packet can time out on this kernel. They are counted rather than assumed, so a workaround is only worth writing if the second number is non-zero."
msgstr "这两个多段计数器是为一个特定问题留的证据：跨多个 USB 包的 PDU 在这个内核上是否会超时。它们是数出来的而不是假设的，因此只有当第二个数字非零时，写规避方案才值得。"

#: view/fm160/gnss.js
msgid "There is no position, so the position rows above are empty rather than zero. An indoor receiver with no sky view reports exactly this, and the module omits the position and time sentences entirely in that state - their absence is not damage."
msgstr "没有定位，因此上面的位置行是空的而不是零。室内看不到天空的接收机报出的正是这个样子，此时模组会完全省略位置与时间语句——它们缺席并不代表损坏。"

#: view/fm160/usb.js
msgid "These are device dependent: the vendor lists them in its port table and says nothing else about them. They are refused unless this is ticked."
msgstr "这些是设备相关的：厂商只在端口表里列了它们，其他一概没说。不勾选就会被拒绝。"

#: view/fm160/usb.js
msgid "This USB profile is not an ECM profile, so fm160d does not dial it."
msgstr "当前 USB 配置不是 ECM 配置，因此 fm160d 不拨它。"

#: view/fm160/cells.js
msgid "This is stored in the modem's own flash and only applied after a UE reset, which this page never performs."
msgstr "这会存入模组自己的 flash，且只在 UE 复位后才应用，而本页面从不执行复位。"

#: view/fm160/gnss.js
msgid "This is stored in the module and survives a power cycle."
msgstr "这会保存在模组里，断电重启后仍然有效。"

#: view/fm160/cells.js
msgid "This modem reports no bands for this RAT."
msgstr "本模组在此 RAT 下没有报告任何频段。"

#: view/fm160/usb.js
msgid "This page is a convenience, not the guard. fm160d re-checks every request: the profile decision runs inside the same function that would send the command, so nothing here can widen what is allowed."
msgstr "本页面只是方便，不是守卫。fm160d 会重新检查每一个请求：配置决策就在那个将要发出命令的函数里执行，所以这里没有任何东西能放宽允许范围。"

#: view/fm160/gnss.js
msgid "This powers up the GNSS receiver. It draws current even while it finds nothing, and on this hardware it is normally the only reason fm160d is talking to the modem at all."
msgstr "这会为 GNSS 接收机供电。即使什么都没搜到它也在耗电，而在这套硬件上，它通常就是 fm160d 与模组通信的唯一原因。"

#: view/fm160/usb.js
msgid "This profile is not in the FM160 AT manual. It appears here only because you asked for the advanced list; nothing documents how it behaves."
msgstr "这个配置不在 FM160 AT 手册里。它出现在这里只是因为你勾选了高级列表；没有任何文档描述它的行为。"

#: view/fm160/sms.js
msgid "This removes the modem's copy (AT+CMGD=%d) as well as the copy held here."
msgstr "这会同时删除模组的副本（AT+CMGD=%d）和这里保存的副本。"

#: view/fm160/overview.js
msgid "This stops all automatic polling. The modem keeps working; only this manager goes quiet until you enable it again."
msgstr "这会停止全部自动轮询。模组本身照常工作，只有本管理器保持静默，直到你重新启用。"

#: view/fm160/usb.js
msgid "This unit reports no profile this firmware knows how to name. Nothing is offered, because on any other platform the same mode numbers mean something else."
msgstr "这台设备报告的配置里没有本固件能命名的。因此不提供任何选项——在别的平台上，同样的模式号含义完全不同。"

#: view/fm160/sms.js
msgid "This will be sent as"
msgstr "将以如下方式发送："

#: view/fm160/cells.js
msgid "This writes %s and is stored in the modem."
msgstr "这会写入 %s，并保存在模组里。"

#: view/fm160/cells.js
msgid "This writes %s, i.e. automatic band selection for every supported RAT."
msgstr "这会写入 %s，即对每种受支持的 RAT 都启用自动选频。"

#: view/fm160/cells.js
msgid "This writes AT+GTCELLLOCK=0."
msgstr "这会写入 AT+GTCELLLOCK=0。"

#: view/fm160/logs.js view/fm160/sms.js
msgid "Time"
msgstr "时间"

#: view/fm160/sms.js
msgid "Time (as stamped)"
msgstr "时间（按戳记）"

#: view/fm160/sms.js
msgid "To"
msgstr "收件人"

#: view/fm160/mwan.js
msgid "Track targets IPv4 (space separated)"
msgstr "IPv4 探测目标（空格分隔）"

#: view/fm160/mwan.js
msgid "Track targets IPv6 (space separated)"
msgstr "IPv6 探测目标（空格分隔）"

#: view/fm160/dial.js view/fm160/overview.js
msgid "Traffic"
msgstr "流量"

#: view/fm160/gnss.js
msgid "Turn the engine off"
msgstr "关闭引擎"

#: view/fm160/gnss.js
